yle=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/06)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 23.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 28\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 6 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Geral:<\/strong> 12.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 03\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a ACURETO Backyard Ultra 2026 e onde \u00e9 a partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A ACURETO Backyard Ultra 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>08h00<\/strong> na sede da ACURETO, em <strong>Toucinhos, Alburitel (Our\u00e9m)<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o formato de corrida Backyard Ultra?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os participantes t\u00eam de completar uma volta de <strong>6.706 km<\/strong> dentro de <strong>60 minutos<\/strong>. A cada hora em ponto \u00e9 dada uma nova partida, sendo eliminados os atletas que n\u00e3o alinhem a tempo. Vence o \u00faltimo atleta a completar uma volta a solo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem dist\u00e2ncias mais acess\u00edveis para al\u00e9m da prova ilimitada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o evento disp\u00f5e do <strong>Desafio 6 Voltas (41 km)<\/strong>, do <strong>Desafio 3 Voltas (20.5 km)<\/strong> e de uma <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 9 km<\/strong> no domingo, 6 de Setembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da ACURETO Backyard Ultra?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Backyard Ultra tem o valor de <strong>50,00 \u20ac<\/strong>. O Desafio 6 Voltas varia entre <strong>25,00 \u20ac e 30,00 \u20ac<\/strong>, o Desafio 3 Voltas entre <strong>18,00 \u20ac e 23,00 \u20ac<\/strong> e a Caminhada fixa-se em <strong>12,50 \u20ac<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <strong>Quero Ir<\/strong> (ou TotalCrono) at\u00e9 3 de Setembro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"ACURETO Backyard Ultra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Toucinhos, Alburitel\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Our\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ACURETO - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Recreativa da Tojeira\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a ACURETO Backyard Ultra 2026 e onde \u00e9 a partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A ACURETO Backyard Ultra 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de Setembro de 2026 , com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 08h00 na sede da ACURETO, em Toucinhos, Alburitel (Our\u00e9m) .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o formato de corrida Backyard Ultra?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os participantes t\u00eam de completar uma volta de 6.706 km dentro de 60 minutos . A cada hora em ponto \u00e9 dada uma nova partida, sendo eliminados os atletas que n\u00e3o alinhem a tempo. Vence o \u00faltimo atleta a completar uma volta a solo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem dist\u00e2ncias mais acess\u00edveis para al\u00e9m da prova ilimitada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o evento disp\u00f5e do Desafio 6 Voltas (41 km) , do Desafio 3 Voltas (20.5 km) e de uma Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 9 km no domingo, 6 de Setembro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"